Keep BF16 weights BF16 when quantizing

Tensor<FloatType>(from:) narrowed BF16 rows to F16. ccv_nnc_tensor_read
cannot convert 16F to 16BF, so the server crashed on the first generation
with a quantized Z-Image or Qwen model. The macOS app keeps them BF16.
